(344369, 27037, 4494, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby what a great shot!!  I''ve tried shots of fighters and they are very hard to capture, like you did here.  Great job!   The sky color really fits well with the steal tone of the plane also.  8</td>', 'Yeah baby what a great shot!!  I''ve tried shots of fighters and they are very hard to capture, like you did here.  Great job!   The sky color really fits well with the steal tone of the plane also.  8', '2003-07-02 03:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(344372, 27003, 7151, '<td valign="top">I get it, but I don''t get it...  What does the flame have to do with speed reading, and why is speed repeated 100+ times, and why does it get smaller and smaller.  I don''t know, maybe too deep for me.<br/> <br/>The photo itself is OK.  Looks like you may have a hot pixel (no vote deduction)  You should have cropped out the bottom left corner.  The background''s a little noisy at the right, and you got what looks like some JPEG artifacts on the paper - don''t compress so much.  The composition is interesting.  The edges of the paper are sharp enough, but the text could be sharper.</td>', 'I get it, but I don''t get it...  What does the flame have to do with speed reading, and why is speed repeated 100+ times, and why does it get smaller and smaller.  I don''t know, maybe too deep for me. The photo itself is OK.  Looks like you may have a hot pixel (no vote deduction)  You should have cropped out the bottom left corner.  The background''s a little noisy at the right, and you got what looks like some JPEG artifacts on the paper - don''t compress so much.  The composition is interesting.  The edges of the paper are sharp enough, but the text could be sharper.', '2003-07-02 03:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(344376, 27136, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - the leaping shows speed.  What game is this?</td>', 'Nice shot - the leaping shows speed.  What game is this?', '2003-07-02 03:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(344378, 27186, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very noisy.  Try NeatImage.  Not a real strong feeling of speed, but definite motion, so it''s at least close.  Composition is a bit tight.</td>', 'Very noisy.  Try NeatImage.  Not a real strong feeling of speed, but definite motion, so it''s at least close.  Composition is a bit tight.', '2003-07-02 03:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
