(344395, 27157, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo is very good but the border is such a distraction.  It''s too white, too big and the drop shadow is fancy but not well suited to the shot.  The simply black and yellow of the main shot would be better on it''s own - which, by the way, is a nice crisp interesting shot.</td>', 'The photo is very good but the border is such a distraction.  It''s too white, too big and the drop shadow is fancy but not well suited to the shot.  The simply black and yellow of the main shot would be better on it''s own - which, by the way, is a nice crisp interesting shot.', '2003-07-02 03:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
