(344399, 27008, 7151, '<td valign="top">Were you going for "speed = distance / time"?  Close enough, since this isn''t math class!  ;-)  Though it doesn''t really convey the sense of speed, I guess it''s a sort of interesting alternate interpretation.  The shot is pretty gray and dark looking.  Don''t know if this was intentional, but it doesn''t really come out very appealing.  The plants also aren''t very sharp, and if you''re going to stress the distance, then you should have showed the total distance traveled (I assume you''re measuring from the ground).</td>', 'Were you going for "speed = distance / time"?  Close enough, since this isn''t math class!  ;-)  Though it doesn''t really convey the sense of speed, I guess it''s a sort of interesting alternate interpretation.  The shot is pretty gray and dark looking.  Don''t know if this was intentional, but it doesn''t really come out very appealing.  The plants also aren''t very sharp, and if you''re going to stress the distance, then you should have showed the total distance traveled (I assume you''re measuring from the ground).', '2003-07-02 03:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
