(345059, 26805, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a simple idea, and I think you did this well. I do think the crop should of been tighter to focus the eye more on the mirror. True the background is part of the speed, but there is a large void/empty space. Not too shabby.....good shootin''!!!</td>', 'Really a simple idea, and I think you did this well. I do think the crop should of been tighter to focus the eye more on the mirror. True the background is part of the speed, but there is a large void/empty space. Not too shabby.....good shootin''!!!', '2003-07-02 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
