(345127, 26956, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and good thinking. I don''t think this works. The snail is lost on the paper. The grass is a distraction and doesn''t really add to the shot. There is a great deal of white area....a void of space doing nothing for the photo. A different composition..?..the snail closer to the racer...tighter crop. You just tried to include too much. I''m guilty of doing the same. I give you high marks for effort and creative thinking.</td>', 'Good idea, and good thinking. I don''t think this works. The snail is lost on the paper. The grass is a distraction and doesn''t really add to the shot. There is a great deal of white area....a void of space doing nothing for the photo. A different composition..?..the snail closer to the racer...tighter crop. You just tried to include too much. I''m guilty of doing the same. I give you high marks for effort and creative thinking.', '2003-07-02 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(345128, 26934, 9703, '<td valign="top">love the compostiion and lighting in this shot. nicely done!</td>', 'love the compostiion and lighting in this shot. nicely done!', '2003-07-02 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
