(345134, 26945, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could of been improved if you''d of cropped out the left by 1/3. That would of focused more on the rider.....the main subject. Still this is good, you have met the challenge of speed. I just think the composition could of been better.</td>', 'I think this shot could of been improved if you''d of cropped out the left by 1/3. That would of focused more on the rider.....the main subject. Still this is good, you have met the challenge of speed. I just think the composition could of been better.', '2003-07-02 13:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
