(345136, 26427, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Top is a bit tight, but I understand your lack of control. Darn bees just don''t fly in on cue do they? LOL Nice color, nice try.</td>', 'Nice capture. Top is a bit tight, but I understand your lack of control. Darn bees just don''t fly in on cue do they? LOL Nice color, nice try.', '2003-07-02 13:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
