(345608, 26945, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very good idea here. I like the composition and you''ve captured "speed" very well. The only small nitpick I have is the bench (I think that''s what it is) on the left hand side of the picture. It''s a darker color than the lake, grass, or tree and is a bit distracting. I think if you crop it off, that would help a lot I think. But still, as is, it''s a very nice photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Very good idea here. I like the composition and you''ve captured "speed" very well. The only small nitpick I have is the bench (I think that''s what it is) on the left hand side of the picture. It''s a darker color than the lake, grass, or tree and is a bit distracting. I think if you crop it off, that would help a lot I think. But still, as is, it''s a very nice photo. Nice job.', '2003-07-02 20:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
