(345990, 26819, 7758, '<td valign="top">seems to blown out in the highlights...... I''m not sure why you chose to crop the wheel out of the bottom but I don''t think it helps the image. Good attempt but I think you need to look at your exposure, I don''t at this stage know what camera you were using but it appears that it may have exposed based on the trees in the background hence the reason you have lost your highlights. Hope this helps. Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'seems to blown out in the highlights...... I''m not sure why you chose to crop the wheel out of the bottom but I don''t think it helps the image. Good attempt but I think you need to look at your exposure, I don''t at this stage know what camera you were using but it appears that it may have exposed based on the trees in the background hence the reason you have lost your highlights. Hope this helps. Good luck, Todd.', '2003-07-03 09:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
