(346917, 26911, 3599, '<td valign="top">Birds are hard to photograph because you can''t always get them to fly right by you like this one.  If your shutter speed was set just a little faster you may have been able to freeze the bird yet still have a blured background.  It''s all about practice and timing.  Good attempt.</td>', 'Birds are hard to photograph because you can''t always get them to fly right by you like this one.  If your shutter speed was set just a little faster you may have been able to freeze the bird yet still have a blured background.  It''s all about practice and timing.  Good attempt.', '2003-07-04 11:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
