(347073, 27182, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perfect title! I love the sense of speed here, but even moreso--the sense of exhilaration caused by speed. A very appropriate and effective image. 9</td>', 'Perfect title! I love the sense of speed here, but even moreso--the sense of exhilaration caused by speed. A very appropriate and effective image. 9', '2003-07-04 16:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
