(347093, 26771, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''ll never forget my first swimming race. Mark Spitz had  just claimed 7 gold medals at the Olympics doing the Butterfly. So I did the butterfly--very badly and came in last place. I can see how she could believe she is going fast, so this image works for me!</td>', 'I''ll never forget my first swimming race. Mark Spitz had  just claimed 7 gold medals at the Olympics doing the Butterfly. So I did the butterfly--very badly and came in last place. I can see how she could believe she is going fast, so this image works for me!', '2003-07-04 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
