(347718, 27159, 9093, '<td valign="top">I wish the rocks weren''t so blown out.  besides that I think it is a good photo.</td>', 'I wish the rocks weren''t so blown out.  besides that I think it is a good photo.', '2003-07-05 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(347722, 26634, 9093, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute photo, but I''m sorry, I don''t see the tie in to speed....</td>', 'It''s a cute photo, but I''m sorry, I don''t see the tie in to speed....', '2003-07-05 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(347725, 27051, 7743, '<td valign="top">Excellent attempt at capturing a difficult subject.  For this challenge a slower shutter speed would give more of a sense of motion and speed.  In this image only the left (from the dog''s perspective) front paw is blurred.  Also, more space on the right for the dog to move into would give the image more impact.</td>', 'Excellent attempt at capturing a difficult subject.  For this challenge a slower shutter speed would give more of a sense of motion and speed.  In this image only the left (from the dog''s perspective) front paw is blurred.  Also, more space on the right for the dog to move into would give the image more impact.', '2003-07-05 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(347732, 26997, 9639, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours, framing, angle, balance of blades in motion and sharpness of badge. Also like the capture of shine on the metal.</td>', 'Excellent colours, framing, angle, balance of blades in motion and sharpness of badge. Also like the capture of shine on the metal.', '2003-07-05 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(347734, 27176, 806, '<td valign="top">a bit of a slanted angle might make this a bit more interesting. Also, the focus could be sharper. I like the motion.. was this handheld? Must have been.. can''t imagine you setting up a tripod in a casino LOL! Neat colors, and just enough blur to give the speed impression, but can still see the symbols. good job.</td>', 'a bit of a slanted angle might make this a bit more interesting. Also, the focus could be sharper. I like the motion.. was this handheld? Must have been.. can''t imagine you setting up a tripod in a casino LOL! Neat colors, and just enough blur to give the speed impression, but can still see the symbols. good job.', '2003-07-05 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(347735, 27022, 9639, '<td valign="top">Very spacey, Tron-like. Has a certain 3D feel to it. Wonderful lighting, nice void in the background. I also like that the spinning top has a certian ghost-ness to it (ie prefer this rather than sharp focus).<br/> <br/>Fantastic.</td>', 'Very spacey, Tron-like. Has a certain 3D feel to it. Wonderful lighting, nice void in the background. I also like that the spinning top has a certian ghost-ness to it (ie prefer this rather than sharp focus). Fantastic.', '2003-07-05 23:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(347736, 27003, 806, '<td valign="top">perhaps a vertical orientation for your camera? nice exposure. interesting idea.</td>', 'perhaps a vertical orientation for your camera? nice exposure. interesting idea.', '2003-07-05 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(347737, 26733, 806, '<td valign="top">nice shot! just wish there was more space infront of him than behind him, but still a great shot!</td>', 'nice shot! just wish there was more space infront of him than behind him, but still a great shot!', '2003-07-05 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(347739, 27021, 806, '<td valign="top">"we can rebuild him.. we have the technology!" okay. now the ''Bionic Man'' song is playing in my head! LOL<br/>Excellent capture! They are running so fast, and you have captured it sooo well! the central figure looks like he is over taking the rest.<br/>Great image, great story telling!</td>', '"we can rebuild him.. we have the technology!" okay. now the ''Bionic Man'' song is playing in my head! LOLExcellent capture! They are running so fast, and you have captured it sooo well! the central figure looks like he is over taking the rest.Great image, great story telling!', '2003-07-05 23:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(347740, 26652, 806, '<td valign="top">it is so hot today! this image makes me want to jump right in! nice job!</td>', 'it is so hot today! this image makes me want to jump right in! nice job!', '2003-07-05 23:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(347741, 26763, 806, '<td valign="top">magazine-like. great "popper wheely" action! nice focus. good work!</td>', 'magazine-like. great "popper wheely" action! nice focus. good work!', '2003-07-05 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(347742, 27101, 9639, '<td valign="top">There''s a number of fairground ride shots entered in the challenge, but this one is IMO the best. It''s predominantly in the tonal depth (the blackness of the blacks), but combined with perfect amount of motion blur, the legible text in foreground, (near) illigible background text, and the subject''s gaze cast off to one side, all adds up to a shot that I can easily imagine in large format framed on a wall.</td>', 'There''s a number of fairground ride shots entered in the challenge, but this one is IMO the best. It''s predominantly in the tonal depth (the blackness of the blacks), but combined with perfect amount of motion blur, the legible text in foreground, (near) illigible background text, and the subject''s gaze cast off to one side, all adds up to a shot that I can easily imagine in large format framed on a wall.', '2003-07-06 00:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(347743, 26805, 806, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a more ominous image in the mirror that makes you look like you are running.. like the police (not that I want them after you, but they could''ve been on the road in another emergency), or a dinosaur toy strapped to your car to get the reflection in the mirror.. <br/>just musing. <br/>I like the clear quality of the shot, and the "woosh" feeling it gives me.<br/></td>', 'I wish there was a more ominous image in the mirror that makes you look like you are running.. like the police (not that I want them after you, but they could''ve been on the road in another emergency), or a dinosaur toy strapped to your car to get the reflection in the mirror.. just musing. I like the clear quality of the shot, and the "woosh" feeling it gives me.', '2003-07-06 00:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(347744, 26666, 9639, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure burn to play down the details, but capture the general feel of things. Nice tones. Good composition of foreground and out of focus background elements.<br/>Bet it makes needle-phobic people cringe!</td>', 'Nice exposure burn to play down the details, but capture the general feel of things. Nice tones. Good composition of foreground and out of focus background elements.Bet it makes needle-phobic people cringe!', '2003-07-06 00:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(347745, 26374, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful job! love the tranquility impression that is in contrast to the speed of the flight. a definite keeper. good work!</td>', 'beautiful job! love the tranquility impression that is in contrast to the speed of the flight. a definite keeper. good work!', '2003-07-06 00:05:34.000000', NULL, 1);
