(347764, 27059, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo its very abstract and creative  Its great that you do something different than the norm. But I really cant tell what it is and I cant tell if there is some speed in it and dont know what this thing on the right is its a little disturbing mabey it would have been good to crop it off. I dont know ... ;) good luck - 6 *little edit* - The more I look a this picture the more I like it Im giving u 8</td>', 'This is a really cool photo its very abstract and creative  Its great that you do something different than the norm. But I really cant tell what it is and I cant tell if there is some speed in it and dont know what this thing on the right is its a little disturbing mabey it would have been good to crop it off. I dont know ... ;) good luck - 6 *little edit* - The more I look a this picture the more I like it Im giving u 8', '2003-07-06 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(347765, 27110, 806, '<td valign="top">great shot! and I like the title too.</td>', 'great shot! and I like the title too.', '2003-07-06 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
