(347812, 26964, 3724, '<td valign="top">First thought, Chelsea pissed off at the fair.  Second....... Beautiful picture, unique tranquility!</td>', 'First thought, Chelsea pissed off at the fair.  Second....... Beautiful picture, unique tranquility!', '2003-07-06 03:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(347826, 27087, 9109, '<td valign="top">Impressive! Good work keeping your focus on the lead biker and blurring the background creating a good feel of how fast they are going, it fits the challenge perfectly!</td>', 'Impressive! Good work keeping your focus on the lead biker and blurring the background creating a good feel of how fast they are going, it fits the challenge perfectly!', '2003-07-06 07:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(347827, 26997, 9109, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone works well for this shot, great composition.</td>', 'The sepia tone works well for this shot, great composition.', '2003-07-06 07:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(347828, 27050, 9109, '<td valign="top">Wow, impressive! It looks as if you have captured the photons themselves! I looked and looked and am not sure how you did this although a hunch tells me that this is a computer screen. I hope you''ll share on how you did this when the voting is over.</td>', 'Wow, impressive! It looks as if you have captured the photons themselves! I looked and looked and am not sure how you did this although a hunch tells me that this is a computer screen. I hope you''ll share on how you did this when the voting is over.', '2003-07-06 07:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(347829, 26820, 9109, '<td valign="top">Great panning skills, but I prefered the bike to be on the left side of the frame showing that he''s left his opponents behind rather than on the right, showing that he still has some more to go. But that''s just my opinion, though.</td>', 'Great panning skills, but I prefered the bike to be on the left side of the frame showing that he''s left his opponents behind rather than on the right, showing that he still has some more to go. But that''s just my opinion, though.', '2003-07-06 07:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(347830, 26634, 9109, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don''t see any "speed" in this shot. Even if you may have meant "an adrenaline rush" the dog just isn''t aggressive enough to suggest that.</td>', 'Sorry but I don''t see any "speed" in this shot. Even if you may have meant "an adrenaline rush" the dog just isn''t aggressive enough to suggest that.', '2003-07-06 07:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(347831, 27200, 9109, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening, for me it''s distracting.</td>', 'Too much sharpening, for me it''s distracting.', '2003-07-06 07:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(347834, 26906, 9109, '<td valign="top">Wow, great panning skills! The cars are amazingly sharp and in focus compared to the background, cool!</td>', 'Wow, great panning skills! The cars are amazingly sharp and in focus compared to the background, cool!', '2003-07-06 07:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(347835, 26432, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very nice! You make it look like the wheel is spinning so fast, it could cut like a sawing disc.</td>', 'Very nice! You make it look like the wheel is spinning so fast, it could cut like a sawing disc.', '2003-07-06 07:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(347836, 26754, 9109, '<td valign="top">Great technique but I feel that the shot is a bit noisy or under-exposed? Some better lighting would certainly have helped rather than bumping up the ISO.</td>', 'Great technique but I feel that the shot is a bit noisy or under-exposed? Some better lighting would certainly have helped rather than bumping up the ISO.', '2003-07-06 08:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(347837, 27071, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Nice shot!</td>', 'Very creative! Nice shot!', '2003-07-06 08:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(347838, 27197, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, the lights make this shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done, the lights make this shot.', '2003-07-06 08:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(347839, 27154, 8274, '<td valign="top">I  give high marks as there two elements of speed conveyed - and at opposites ends of the spectrum.</td>', 'I  give high marks as there two elements of speed conveyed - and at opposites ends of the spectrum.', '2003-07-06 08:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(347851, 26740, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is kind of a neat abstract.  I have no idea what it is.  Judging by the title, I''d say it was a MIG welder or something, but i see no connection to that in the photo.  Not a bad pic.  I think the title loses me more than the photo does.</td>', 'This is kind of a neat abstract.  I have no idea what it is.  Judging by the title, I''d say it was a MIG welder or something, but i see no connection to that in the photo.  Not a bad pic.  I think the title loses me more than the photo does.', '2003-07-06 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(347853, 26979, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo looks grainy in a very unnatural way.  It almost looks like it was added post.  The idea is okay.  The line cutting thru the middle of the pic diagonally is not helping the continuity of this pic.</td>', 'This photo looks grainy in a very unnatural way.  It almost looks like it was added post.  The idea is okay.  The line cutting thru the middle of the pic diagonally is not helping the continuity of this pic.', '2003-07-06 09:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(347855, 27019, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good panning technique.  A nice crisp shot.  Looks a little underexposed, like the shutter was too fast (which in turn helped keep the shot crisp).  Moving left to right is a more natural feel for the eye.  Moving R to L is not as natural.  I might have considered flipping the photo so the boat was moving L to R, if you can get away with it.</td>', 'Good panning technique.  A nice crisp shot.  Looks a little underexposed, like the shutter was too fast (which in turn helped keep the shot crisp).  Moving left to right is a more natural feel for the eye.  Moving R to L is not as natural.  I might have considered flipping the photo so the boat was moving L to R, if you can get away with it.', '2003-07-06 09:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(347856, 26634, 1368, '<td valign="top">Its cute But there is no speed here. And would have been better without the shadow on the nose and mabey crop a little of the dark area to the right Good luck :)</td>', 'Its cute But there is no speed here. And would have been better without the shadow on the nose and mabey crop a little of the dark area to the right Good luck :)', '2003-07-06 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
