(347859, 26964, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great picture.   I''m not really sure where you are intending for us to see speed here.  I like the silhouette and the warm color of the sky.</td>', 'Great picture.   I''m not really sure where you are intending for us to see speed here.  I like the silhouette and the warm color of the sky.', '2003-07-06 09:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
