(349057, 26964, 8860, '<td valign="top">A thoughtful shot. I too conceived the speed of the earth/universe relationship, but I couldn''t think of a good way to express it. This is an evokative interpretation although it doesn''t really fulfill the brief of the challenge to give the sensation or illusion of speed. [6]</td>', 'A thoughtful shot. I too conceived the speed of the earth/universe relationship, but I couldn''t think of a good way to express it. This is an evokative interpretation although it doesn''t really fulfill the brief of the challenge to give the sensation or illusion of speed. [6]', '2003-07-07 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
