(349063, 27098, 8860, '<td valign="top">You needed to be closer to the subject really, or shoot it as it passes you at the nearest point, which would give you more peripheral ''motion blur''. An off-centre subject could have improved it too (car to the right - suggesting it''s passing fast). [4]</td>', 'You needed to be closer to the subject really, or shoot it as it passes you at the nearest point, which would give you more peripheral ''motion blur''. An off-centre subject could have improved it too (car to the right - suggesting it''s passing fast). [4]', '2003-07-07 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
