(349155, 27076, 9886, '<td valign="top">Great idea ... reminds me how I should get out a bit more to take my snaps. And i''m just dying to give that big red button a push. It''s a shame you had to make a choice about getting either the newspaper edge perpendicular to the shot, or the edge of the machines, but I think you chose right.</td>', 'Great idea ... reminds me how I should get out a bit more to take my snaps. And i''m just dying to give that big red button a push. It''s a shame you had to make a choice about getting either the newspaper edge perpendicular to the shot, or the edge of the machines, but I think you chose right.', '2003-07-07 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(349156, 27050, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot. It sorta reminds me of sci fi movies when they use warp speed.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot. It sorta reminds me of sci fi movies when they use warp speed.', '2003-07-07 15:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
