(349295, 27142, 9893, '<td valign="top">I like seeing the mountains and chair lifts in the background, but I''d like to be closer to the snowboarder.  Cropping would help this photo.</td>', 'I like seeing the mountains and chair lifts in the background, but I''d like to be closer to the snowboarder.  Cropping would help this photo.', '2003-07-07 16:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(349301, 27070, 9893, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful, but it''s a little grainy.  Also, I''m not sure I like the head-on angle and how it''s centered in a square.  This adds abstraction (I never would have known what it was without the title), but I think it could be more dynamic from another view.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful, but it''s a little grainy.  Also, I''m not sure I like the head-on angle and how it''s centered in a square.  This adds abstraction (I never would have known what it was without the title), but I think it could be more dynamic from another view.', '2003-07-07 16:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(349302, 27109, 1368, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2003-07-07 16:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(349303, 26454, 9893, '<td valign="top">This is too instensely saturated and too grainy for my liking.  Nice composition though.</td>', 'This is too instensely saturated and too grainy for my liking.  Nice composition though.', '2003-07-07 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
