(349311, 26634, 9941, '<td valign="top">That dog is hilarious!  It''s not the best photo I''ve ever seen, but hey, it made me laugh!</td>', 'That dog is hilarious!  It''s not the best photo I''ve ever seen, but hey, it made me laugh!', '2003-07-07 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
