(349323, 26992, 9941, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but failed to capture any emotion, which is tough.  You''ve gotta be in the right place at the right time.</td>', 'Good composition, but failed to capture any emotion, which is tough.  You''ve gotta be in the right place at the right time.', '2003-07-07 16:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
