(349642, 27138, 3540, '<td valign="top">If you gave this one a little more room out in front of the car, 10.  Settle for 9?</td>', 'If you gave this one a little more room out in front of the car, 10.  Settle for 9?', '2003-07-07 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(349644, 27173, 9093, '<td valign="top">Is that one of those Fiber Optic toys from the 80''s?  I would love to see this image with the light source hidden in some way so that you only see the strands of light mysteriously flying in front of her.  Good job! 8</td>', 'Is that one of those Fiber Optic toys from the 80''s?  I would love to see this image with the light source hidden in some way so that you only see the strands of light mysteriously flying in front of her.  Good job! 8', '2003-07-07 22:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(349650, 26932, 9093, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this photo shows exactly what I would want to see representing speed.  The slightly blurred background, the flowing hair and the water shooting back all lend well to the messege of the topic.  The white around the numbers on the front might be a little over exposed but I barely notice it.</td>', 'In my opinion this photo shows exactly what I would want to see representing speed.  The slightly blurred background, the flowing hair and the water shooting back all lend well to the messege of the topic.  The white around the numbers on the front might be a little over exposed but I barely notice it.', '2003-07-07 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(349653, 26771, 5603, '<td valign="top">The water is too distracting.  If the pool had been drained and the child was floating on the air over the pool while flapping her arms and kicking her legs then it would have been much more effective.  Especially if a large fan was placed strategically so that her hair was blowing backwards.   It''s too wet in this photograph.  I also don''t like her bathing suit color.  It clashes with the color of the water and slows down the speed effect you were trying to achieve.   What is your point here anyway?   I''m very upset.</td>', 'The water is too distracting.  If the pool had been drained and the child was floating on the air over the pool while flapping her arms and kicking her legs then it would have been much more effective.  Especially if a large fan was placed strategically so that her hair was blowing backwards.   It''s too wet in this photograph.  I also don''t like her bathing suit color.  It clashes with the color of the water and slows down the speed effect you were trying to achieve.   What is your point here anyway?   I''m very upset.', '2003-07-07 22:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(349655, 27204, 9093, '<td valign="top">Did you enter this photo twice?  There''s another tilt a whirl photo from the same angle also titled, "Whee".  Oh well.  I''ve seen stranger coincidences.</td>', 'Did you enter this photo twice?  There''s another tilt a whirl photo from the same angle also titled, "Whee".  Oh well.  I''ve seen stranger coincidences.', '2003-07-07 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
