(350498, 27143, 7339, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Cant wait to see how you shot it. I think its a stroboscopic flash, like I used on my self portrait. Only yours is done much better. Great control of the dark background (something that plagues me still). Focus is sharp on the racked even though it has to be moving just a bit from the ball, unless you got this dropping it onto the racket on the way down. Cool Im even more intrigued. 2 more hours and Ill have my answer... Great job.</td>', 'Cool shot. Cant wait to see how you shot it. I think its a stroboscopic flash, like I used on my self portrait. Only yours is done much better. Great control of the dark background (something that plagues me still). Focus is sharp on the racked even though it has to be moving just a bit from the ball, unless you got this dropping it onto the racket on the way down. Cool Im even more intrigued. 2 more hours and Ill have my answer... Great job.', '2003-07-08 22:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(350505, 27076, 806, '<td valign="top">the contrast is the only thing on this keeping me from giving it a 10. I like the motion, speed, composition, subject matter... but the colors are muted... not that the area is gray.. but the whole image has a gray cast. Perhaps it was the lighting.. but it could have used a boost.</td>', 'the contrast is the only thing on this keeping me from giving it a 10. I like the motion, speed, composition, subject matter... but the colors are muted... not that the area is gray.. but the whole image has a gray cast. Perhaps it was the lighting.. but it could have used a boost.', '2003-07-08 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
