(350601, 27037, 7339, '<td valign="top">Talk about psyched!. Thanks for the great comments. This is tightly cropped and processed with neat image. Alan you were correct on the location, where you there? However it was shot with my 10D so I got ya there. I never posted this shot anywhere else so would be surprised if you saw this exact image anywhere else. I will post my original later so you can see how it was cropped and done for the final. Thanks again for the great comments. Ya baby!</td>', 'Talk about psyched!. Thanks for the great comments. This is tightly cropped and processed with neat image. Alan you were correct on the location, where you there? However it was shot with my 10D so I got ya there. I never posted this shot anywhere else so would be surprised if you saw this exact image anywhere else. I will post my original later so you can see how it was cropped and done for the final. Thanks again for the great comments. Ya baby!', '2003-07-09 01:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
