(350964, 26733, 917, '<td valign="top">From your comment, it seems you dont realise that this is a hoverfly (Episyrphus balteatus), and is in the same order (Diptera) as houseflies and fruit flies, rather than the bees-wasps-ants order (Hymenoptera). A wasp on the wing would be *really* hard to capture, as they dont hang about and spend hardly any time at all at each flower. Congrats on a top 10 place.</td>', 'From your comment, it seems you dont realise that this is a hoverfly (Episyrphus balteatus), and is in the same order (Diptera) as houseflies and fruit flies, rather than the bees-wasps-ants order (Hymenoptera). A wasp on the wing would be *really* hard to capture, as they dont hang about and spend hardly any time at all at each flower. Congrats on a top 10 place.', '2003-07-09 08:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(350985, 26732, 5628, '<td valign="top">Congrats to those of you who guessed right. This is a model. Pity many people didn''t agree with my interpretation though. I wonder how much I would''ve scored, had it not been a little off the challenge. Can''t believe I miss-spelled Boxster though...</td>', 'Congrats to those of you who guessed right. This is a model. Pity many people didn''t agree with my interpretation though. I wonder how much I would''ve scored, had it not been a little off the challenge. Can''t believe I miss-spelled Boxster though...', '2003-07-09 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 0),
