(351550, 27037, 714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Diversq:</b></div><hr/><i>Wow Alan, thats too funny. I saw this photographer at the air show. He was about 15 feet to my right. I remember checking out his camera and I think he spotted me too. It was funny really because a young girl behind me commented to her father and I overheard her say, Dad is that camera a digital camera like ours (he had a small point and shoot digital) and he said back to her, no honey, that camera probably costs more then our car. <br/> <br/>I turned at that point and smiled at him. Then showed his family this shot and they were impressed. His son then said he wanted a camera like that and asked if his dad would get him one. He replied, its either that or college. Everyone laughed and we went back to watching the show.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL...Great story!<br/>Great picture too.  You did good, congrats!</td>', 'Originally posted by Diversq:Wow Alan, thats too funny. I saw this photographer at the air show. He was about 15 feet to my right. I remember checking out his camera and I think he spotted me too. It was funny really because a young girl behind me commented to her father and I overheard her say, Dad is that camera a digital camera like ours (he had a small point and shoot digital) and he said back to her, no honey, that camera probably costs more then our car.  I turned at that point and smiled at him. Then showed his family this shot and they were impressed. His son then said he wanted a camera like that and asked if his dad would get him one. He replied, its either that or college. Everyone laughed and we went back to watching the show.  LOL...Great story!Great picture too.  You did good, congrats!', '2003-07-09 16:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
