(352143, 27101, 9639, '<td valign="top">I was *very* disappointed this shot placed so low. I think it''s head and shoulders above many of the others! I mean, really... how many speeding planes, trains and automobiles can we stomach? Grey plane on grey background anyone? <br/> <br/>Oh well! Still love to see it framed on the wall. If only I had the cash. In the meantime, keep at it!</td>', 'I was *very* disappointed this shot placed so low. I think it''s head and shoulders above many of the others! I mean, really... how many speeding planes, trains and automobiles can we stomach? Grey plane on grey background anyone?  Oh well! Still love to see it framed on the wall. If only I had the cash. In the meantime, keep at it!', '2003-07-10 03:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
