(352291, 27204, 4482, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the CC!<br/> <br/>THEME: at a 1st glance it looked like a marigoround but then I saw the movement so yes, it meets the theme.<br/> <br/>LIGHT AND COLOR: I know some people mentioned that it was under-ex.. this doesn''t bother me here. It''s a night shot and it works for me. For this type of image I would''ve boosted the color saturation a tad as they look faded.<br/> <br/>FOCUS: Good<br/> <br/>COMPOSITION: the angle doesn'' t work here. It doesn''t add to movement in the pic and more distracting then anything. I would''ve chosen a ride that had lights on the moving carts becuse my eye isn''t drawn to the "moving" part of your photo.<br/> <br/>Keep it up!<br/> <br/>Yanik</td>', 'Greetings from the CC! THEME: at a 1st glance it looked like a marigoround but then I saw the movement so yes, it meets the theme. LIGHT AND COLOR: I know some people mentioned that it was under-ex.. this doesn''t bother me here. It''s a night shot and it works for me. For this type of image I would''ve boosted the color saturation a tad as they look faded. FOCUS: Good COMPOSITION: the angle doesn'' t work here. It doesn''t add to movement in the pic and more distracting then anything. I would''ve chosen a ride that had lights on the moving carts becuse my eye isn''t drawn to the "moving" part of your photo. Keep it up! Yanik', '2003-07-10 08:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
