(355323, 26729, 9331, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jaxson:</b></div><hr/><i>Excellent shot!!<br/>Can I ask if you used a tripod/monopod?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was taken with a tripod. The surf was breaking in one particular direction, so it was easy to set it up pointing at one spot where the surfers were going to travel past</td>', 'Originally posted by Jaxson:Excellent shot!!Can I ask if you used a tripod/monopod?  It was taken with a tripod. The surf was breaking in one particular direction, so it was easy to set it up pointing at one spot where the surfers were going to travel past', '2003-07-13 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
