(356845, 27037, 7799, '<td valign="top">Superb.... I was an Air Force photographer for 22 1/2 years.... This is really a very dynamic photograph.  Contrast lines around the gray aircraft set it off from the gray background... subtle canopy color and afterburner lite are so nice.  Way to Go!!  I''m impressed.</td>', 'Superb.... I was an Air Force photographer for 22 1/2 years.... This is really a very dynamic photograph.  Contrast lines around the gray aircraft set it off from the gray background... subtle canopy color and afterburner lite are so nice.  Way to Go!!  I''m impressed.', '2003-07-15 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
