(904906, 27051, 3214, '<td valign="top">Mingo is his name, a rescued/tortured pit bull cross.  I''ve learned a lot since posting that shot, and now use a camera with better dynamic range to avoid the blown highlights, 30,000 images since with a lot of self-assignments.  Thanks for the comments!  Lynne</td>', 'Mingo is his name, a rescued/tortured pit bull cross.  I''ve learned a lot since posting that shot, and now use a camera with better dynamic range to avoid the blown highlights, 30,000 images since with a lot of self-assignments.  Thanks for the comments!  Lynne', '2004-09-11 17:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
